The directory contains some simple ELAN examples in the context of Programming.

Subdirectories:
===============

Prolog/ : Standard Prolog via CLP operational semantics 
          elan clp fibCLP.spc < SAMPLES/ex1.inp
          elan clp arithmeticCLP.spc < SAMPLES/ex2.inp

elanlibCP/ : my own version of some ELAN modules related to 
             terms, variables, atoms, ...
            elan clp fibCLP.spc < SAMPLES/ex1.inp
            elan clp arithmeticCLP.spc < SAMPLES/ex2.inp


============================================================================

For any problem/comment/bug, feel free to contact elan@loria.fr

